The project involved a complete internal strip out and refit, integrating commercial kitchen extraction systems and compliance with strict fire, health, and hygiene standards.

\
The design maximizes the compact footprint to provide an efficient service area and comfortable customer seating, successfully navigating local planning constraints for hot food premise.
